title: SymBro
abstract: >-
  A CLI/pipeline for symmetry-broken protein cage design: RCSB query,
  download, symmetry-ring geometry analysis, ring subunit isolation,
  RFdiffusion, ProteinMPNN, and structure-prediction screening.
type: software
authors:
